╭ Proxie│ Parked is dim. Green brightness is throughput.                                  │10/65536│
│up     │ A bright dot fades after recent traffic. proxy.afterglow_seconds sets the time. │        │
│dropped│ One dot is one proxy. A cell has upper and lower dots.                          │        │
│connect│ Groups show the worst state. Hover or click for addresses.                      │────────╯
│dead   │ Mono uses blocks. Colorblind uses blocks and the worst state style.             │
╰───────│ Colorblind uses bold and dim. Hover for each state.                             │
